_radio_index/

# Promoted catalogue media — copied into the served layer by `npm run radio:promote`
# from _radio_index/suno_backup. Large (~12GB per mirror) and regenerable; not source.
# Keeps the source cover SVGs and PHKD_AUDIO_PLACEHOLDER.json tracked.
apps/web/public/radio-html/assets/audio/*.mp3
apps/web/public/radio-html/assets/covers/*.jpeg
apps/desktop/public/radio-html/assets/audio/*.mp3
apps/desktop/public/radio-html/assets/covers/*.jpeg

